sequenceDiagram
    actor P as Patient
    participant UI as React UI
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant DB as SQLite
    P->>UI: Select an available slot and confirm
    UI->>API: POST /api/appointments with token and slot ID
    API->>DB: Load selected slot
    DB-->>API: Slot state and start time
    alt Future slot is available
        API->>DB: Commit confirmed appointment and booked slot
        API-->>UI: Confirmed appointment
        UI-->>P: Show confirmation
    else Slot missing, booked, or past
        API-->>UI: HTTP 400 with availability message
        UI-->>P: Show error
    end
